  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:kol_meqaddesh/1">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/1"/>Whoever sanctifies the seventh day
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/2"/>as befits it,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/3"/>Whoever preserves the Sabbath properly
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/4"/>so as not to desecrate it—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/5"/>his reward is very great,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/6"/>commensurate with his actions;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/7"/>each man in his camp,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/8"/>each man with his banner.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/9"/>Lovers of Adonoy, who yearn
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/10"/>for the building of the Temple—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/11"/>on the Sabbath day be happy and rejoice,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/12"/>as if receiving the gift of God's inheritance.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/13"/>Also raise your hands in holiness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/14"/>and say to the Almighty:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:kings_1/8/56"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/15"/>“Blessed is Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/16"/>Who granted rest
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kol_meqaddesh/1/17"/>to His people Israel.”<tei:anchor xml:id="note_2"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
